<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-model-fidelity> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Pezzulo & Levin (2015) / Friston et al. (2015) bioelectric target morphology memory and Variational Free Energy homeostasis — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements the Pezzulo & Levin (2015) and Friston, Levin, Sengupta & Pezzulo (2015) Variational Free Energy functional F(mu, x), coupled perception dmu/dt = -kappa_mu*dF/dmu and morphogenetic action dx/dt = -kappa_a*dF/dx ODEs, monotonic Lyapunov dissipation dF/dt <= 0, and 3-segment proximodistal + organ-identity dynamics (L126-342), verified by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_084_bioelectric_target_morphology_memory.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-morphometric-validation> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Pezzulo & Levin (2015) / Friston et al. (2015) bioelectric target morphology memory and Variational Free Energy homeostasis — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 6 reference-anchored quantitative morphometric measurements via `measure_morphoeval()` (L770-880): proximal vs distal regenerated target length (1.0000 vs 1.0 reference, equifinality error = 0.000000), proximal-to-distal initial blastema growth velocity ratio (2.6667 vs 2.6667 = 8/3 exact theoretical ratio), Farinella-Ferruzza tail-to-limb organ identity remodeling delta (+2.0000 vs +2.0 reference), rewritten bioelectric memory vs denervated arrest length contrast (1.2500 vs 1.25 reference), specimen vs simulated forelimb width profile correlation (Pearson r = 0.8711, width RMSE = 0.1240, segment fraction RMSE = 0.0889), and 5-regime target length prediction RMSE = 0.0000." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-measurement-ambystoma-mexicanum-specimen-vs-simulated-regenerated-forelimb-width-profile-correlation-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-measurement-farinella-ferruzza-ectopic-tail-to-limb-graft-identity-remodeling-delta>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-measurement-pezzulo-levin-2015-5-regime-regenerated-organ-length-prediction-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-measurement-proximal-to-distal-initial-blastema-growth-velocity-ratio-v-prox-v-dist>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-measurement-proximal-vs-distal-salamander-limb-regeneration-target-length-equifinality-error>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-measurement-rewritten-bioelectric-target-setpoint-memory-vs-denervated-pi-s-0-arrest-length-contrast>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-overall> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Pezzulo & Levin (2015) / Friston et al. (2015) bioelectric target morphology memory and Variational Free Energy homeostasis — MorphoEval overall 91.5/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2015-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory.py` (91.6/100, up from 59.6/100 in Pass 1; +32.0 overall). The remediated script integrates the coupled Pezzulo & Levin (2015) and Friston et al. (2015) Variational Free Energy gradient flow over 3 proximodistal salamander limb segments (stylopod, zeugopod, autopod) and organ identity psi(t), reproducing all 5 canonical experimental regimes with zero target-length error (RMSE = 0.0000): proximal shoulder amputation (`L_0 = 0.20 -> 1.0000`), distal wrist amputation (`L_0 = 0.70 -> 1.0000`, equifinality discrepancy < 1e-6 and initial velocity ratio `v_prox/v_dist = 2.6667 = 8/3`), Farinella-Ferruzza tail-to-limb graft remodeling (`psi: -1.0 -> +1.0, L -> 1.0000`), rewritten bioelectric setpoint memory (`mu_target' = 1.45 -> L = 1.4500`), and Singer (1952) denervated sensory-precision ablation negative control (`Pi_s = 0 -> L = 0.2000` complete stump arrest), alongside automated forelimb skeleton and width segmentation on `salamander_limb_regeneration_specimen.jpg` (`r = 0.8711`), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_084_bioelectric_target_morphology_memory.lean`. Overall 91.5/100 (faithfulness 91.4, reproducibility 91.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit b2936f6; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 93, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/bioelectric_target_morphology_memory_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory.py at b2936f6, image/png, 1009309 B, 2268×1863 px, artifact_sha256 e5d2033311420793acded2c7d8a60502ea97b8f28d2e3a025a7f3acb2e3825a0 (sha256 e5d2033311420793acded2c7d8a60502ea97b8f28d2e3a025a7f3acb2e3825a0), spec_fingerprint 76f53df6fe2e78cfcaffeee38c874bcb67b673c1a916f9045c6a97417b660f71. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 76f53df6fe2e78cfcaffeee38c874bcb67b673c1a916f9045c6a97417b660f71; artifact_sha256: e5d2033311420793acded2c7d8a60502ea97b8f28d2e3a025a7f3acb2e3825a0; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/bioelectric_target_morphology_memory/bioelectric_target_morphology_memory_reference.json=3e8e26ed216e74ce..., datasets/bioelectric_target_morphology_memory/paper_citations.bib=4235fafcb6076581..., datasets/bioelectric_target_morphology_memory/salamander_limb_regeneration_specimen.jpg=fe57ed2c5909e7af..., datasets/bioelectric_target_morphology_memory/scout_manifest.json=7d75a04159b0641d...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Pezzulo & Levin (2015) J. R. Soc. Interface 12:20150772 & Friston, Levin, Sengupta & Pezzulo (2015) J. R. Soc. Interface 12:20141383 Variational Free Energy minimization F(mu, x) and active-inference homeostatic error-correction toward stored bioelectric target morphology setpoints | Proximal vs distal salamander limb amputation equifinality (exact stop at L* = 1.00), Farinella-Ferruzza tail-to-limb graft remodeling, rewritten bioelectric target setpoint memory, and Singer (1952) denervation arrest (Pi_s = 0); reconstructed_in_script: Coupled 4D active-inference ODE solver for 3 proximodistal limb segments (stylopod, zeugopod, autopod) and organ identity psi(t) plus spatial bioelectric V_mem(s,t) kymograph across 5 experimental regimes | Articulated right forelimb skeleton (shoulder, elbow, wrist, autopod; L = 269.6 px) and 40-bin width profile segmentation on salamander_limb_regeneration_specimen.jpg (Pearson r = 0.8711) and 2D 4-digit forelimb silhouette synthesis; transfer_boundary: Proximodistal 3-segment active-inference trajectories mapped onto 2D articulated Ambystoma mexicanum forelimb silhouettes and joint landmarks; does_not_claim: Single-cell transcriptomic trajectories of blastema dedifferentiation or 3D finite-element bone mineralization mechanics." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 3-segment proximodistal active-inference controller to a 2D reaction-diffusion Sox9/BMP/Wnt digit-condensation PDE in the autopod paddle.",
        "remediation needed: Incorporate explicit gap-junctional spatial averaging of V_mem prediction errors across a 2D blastema cell lattice." ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.15e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

